oving forward. This way, I can better assist with the task at hand! Let's find those items!\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_46jMet5oMg6bvaj5zqzW7ifc|fc_086b533551db42ec0169cd251bcb1c819196bc7f4733cd1670","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"OPENCLAW-PROJECT tracked items existing issues opportunities GitHub plugin weixin Discord InStreet","maxResults":10},"partialJson":"{\"query\":\"OPENCLAW-PROJECT tracked items existing issues opportunities GitHub plugin weixin Discord InStreet\", \"maxResults\": 10}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":18059,"output":57,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19652,"cost":{"input":0.04514750000000001,"output":0.0008550000000000001,"cacheRead":0.000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.04638650000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775052049123,"responseId":"resp_086b533551db42ec0169cd25117d288191a872111fb9ec0a85"}}
{"type":"message","id":"0d15b51d","parentId":"42b00d9b","timestamp":"2026-04-01T14:01:00.202Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_46jMet5oMg6bvaj5zqzW7ifc|fc_086b533551db42ec0169cd251bcb1c819196bc7f4733cd1670","toolName":"memory_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cb53571912e36014200692f4245b6b88c3fd26ca811ca3fb6d5aaa719f345c9f\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 21,\n      \"endLine\": 42,\n      \"score\": 0.8384338811075842,\n      \"textScore\": 0.8384338811075842,\n      \"snippet\": \"发现了0个值得关注的实战问题（主要是API使用指南文档）\\n\\n#### Discord OpenClaw 社区（方向3）\\n无法访问（GitHub discussions被禁用），未发现新讨论\\n\\n#### 插件仓库（方向4）\\n发现了2个相关问题：\\n- **#57536** - feishu plugin鉴权失败\\n- **#57452** - Telegram media download被SSRF guard拦截\\n\\n### 结论和建议\\n**最高优先级是#57551（kimi无限递归重试）和#57550（HTTP API Token认证失败）**，都是2026.3.28的严重regression：\\n- #57551导致edit工具完全失效，token被无限消耗\\n- #57550导致所有RESTful HTTP API集成中断\\n\\n**建议**：aoao立即处理这两个P0问题，同时关注4个P1问题。\\n\\n### 备注\\n- 项目跟踪文件已更新（OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md）\\n- 扫描数据完整，但无法发送给 main agent（session 不可用或超时）\\n- 建议手动审查 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 中的新扫描记录\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L21-L42\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L21-L42\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"83f855485033bfc27f820a2cf1ec2e15953a62f586bdd289ff73b36a1439cfb3\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 76,\n      \"endLine\": 86,\n      \"score\": 0.8246548870674301,\n      \"textScore\": 0.8246548870674301,\n      \"snippet\": \"- main（No session found with label: main）\\n     - agent:main:main（timeout）\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 建议后续行动\\n\\n- 检查 main session 的正确标识符或启动方式\\n- 或者通过其他渠道（如飞书消息）通知 main\\n- 当前扫描结果已保存在 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 中，可供查看\\n\\nSource: memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L76-L86\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",