g]: Agent display name/avatar reverts to bot default on edited Slack messages (regression)\\n- **类型**：bug + regression\\n- **严重度**：低（Slack UX 问题）\\n- **root cause**：Slack chat.update API 静默丢弃 username 和 icon_url 参数\\n- **影响**：工具调用完成后消息编辑时，agent 显示名和头像恢复为 bot 默认值\\n- **可修性**：S（需要在 chat.update 时保留原 username/icon_url）\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\\n\\n**#58734**\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L32-L58\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L32-L58\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"94505b8fd2affdb180753202d8749750a9aaabf1f0ce62c536a6ce00f58caaa3\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 1,\n      \"endLine\": 31,\n      \"score\": 0.7684100759536899,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7684100759536899,\n      \"snippet\": \"# 扫描报告发送记录 [2026-03-30 06:55 UTC]\\n\\n## 发送状态：失败\\n\\n### 尝试发送给 main agent\\n- Session key 1: `main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8` → 失败（No session found）\\n- Session key 2: `agent:main:main` → 失败（timeout）\\n\\n### 扫描数据（已记录在 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md）\\n\\n#### GitHub Issues（方向1）\\n发现了85个新候选（过去2小时内更新），其中最重要的是：\\n- **#57551** - [Bug]: kimi无限递归重试，把我模型token都跑光了（P0，regression）\\n- **#57550** - [Bug]: v3.28+ HTTP API broken: pure Token auth throws \\\"missing scope: operator.write\\\"（P0，regression）\\n- **#57540** - Isolated cron sessions fail with LiveSessionModelSwitchError（P1）\\n- **#57538** - claude-haiku-4-5 missing from bundled catalog（P1，silent cost regression 5-6x）\\n- **#57536** - [Bug]: feishu:tenant_a\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"edfc84cef32526d1f14ebf02065be12f1fde65b5d9ede7bbe617bb187bf05867\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 227,\n      \"endLine\": 265,\n      \"score\": 0.7681268233729597,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7681268233729597,\n      \"snippet\": \"- **root cause**：Plugin subagent calls 间歇性失败，提示\\\"Plugin runtime subagent methods are only available during a gateway request.\\\"\\n- **影响**：\\n  1. Plugin subagent 调用不稳定\\n  2. 某些 plugin 功能间歇性失效\\n  3. 用户体验不可预测\\n- **可修性**：M\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\\n\\n#### P2 - Medium 优先级问题\\n\\n**#58416** - [Bug]: Voice call plugin TTS config\\n- **类型**：bug\\n- **严重度**：中（Voice call plugin TTS 配置问题）\\n- **root cause**：Voice call plugin TTS 配置有问题\\n- **影响**：\\n  1. Voice call TTS 功能可能失效\\n  2. 语音配置不正确\\n- **可修性**：M\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\\n\\n**#58415** - [Bug]: ws-stream WebSocket connect fails with 500 and always falls back to HTTP (Telegram still works)\\n- **类型**：bug\\n- **严重度**：中（ws-stream WebSocket 连接失败）\\n- **ro\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L227-L265\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L227-L265\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"30028d86d604edeb0aa9cb632008973f7f9a133223942517c67103d92177313f\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 258,\n      \"endLine\": 304,\n      \"score\": 0.7681268233729597,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7681268233729597,\n      \"snippet\": \"- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\\n\\n**#58411** - sessions_spawn lacks --bind here equivalent — agent cannot bind ACP session to existing Discord thread\\n- **类型**：enhancement\\n- **严重度**：中（功能缺失）\\n- **root cause**：sessions_spawn 缺少 --bind here 等价物\\n- **影响**：\\n  1. Agent 无法将 ACP session 绑定到现有的 Discord thread\\n  2. ACP 集成功能受限\\n- **可修性**：M\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\\n\\n**#58423** - [Bug] webchat channel: file attachments not passed to AI context via chat.send\\n- **类型**：bug\\n- **严重度**：中（webchat 文件附件问题）\\n- **root cause**：webchat channel 中文件附件没有通过 chat.send 传递给 AI 上下文\\n- **影响**：\\n  1. Webchat 用户无法上传文件\\n  2. 文件分析功能失效\\n- **可修性**：M\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n- **来源**：GitH