8 后 agent 进入无限重试循环并死锁\n- 建议：aoao 立即处理\n\n**次优先级：#58457（Ollama Cloud provider 鉴权失效）**\n- 问题：Ollama Cloud provider 即使使用有效 API key 也返回 401 错误\n- 建议：aoao 优先修复\n\n---\n\n## 已完成的交付\n\n1. ✅ 更新了 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 文件\n   - 添加了新的扫描结果（2026-03-31 16:14 UTC）\n   - 更新了当前优先级表格（新增 5 个问题）\n\n2. ❌ sessions_send 到 main 失败\n   - 错误：timeout\n   - 尝试的 sessionKey：\n     - main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abee\n\nSource: memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L36-L85","source":"memory","citation":"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L36-L85"},{"id":"99ac7fd56ed2d8498d9eca954d629bfadbb63b3cc5ee4d1e78b99b4b8b4e8d9e","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":32,"endLine":58,"score":0.7915201221176097,"textScore":0.7915201221176097,"snippet":"#### P2 - Medium 优先级问题\n\n**#58738** - [Bug]: ClawBot 微信服务号无响应，已扫码绑定但收发消息失败 (regression)\n- **类型**：bug + regression\n- **严重度**：中（WeChat channel 完全失效）\n- **root cause**：v2026.3.31 升级后 ClawBot 服务号绑定失效\n- **影响**：微信消息无法收发，定时推送功能失效\n- **可修性**：N/A（代码不可见）\n- **推荐**：标注\"代码不可见\"，建议排查 v2026.3.31 的 weixin 相关变更\n- **来源**：GitHub issues（weixin 相关）\n\n**#58737** - [Bug]: Agent display name/avatar reverts to bot default on edited Slack messages (regression)\n- **类型**：bug + regression\n- **严重度**：低（Slack UX 问题）\n- **root cause**：Slack chat.update API 静默丢弃 username 和 icon_url 参数\n- **影响**：工具调用完成后消息编辑时，agent 显示名和头像恢复为 bot 默认值\n- **可修性**：S（需要在 chat.update 时保留原 username/icon_url）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n**#58734**\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L32-L58","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L32-L58"},{"id":"94505b8fd2affdb180753202d8749750a9aaabf1f0ce62c536a6ce00f58caaa3","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md","startLine":1,"endLine":31,"score":0.7684100759536899,"textScore":0.7684100759536899,"snippet":"# 扫描报告发送记录 [2026-03-30 06:55 UTC]\n\n## 发送状态：失败\n\n### 尝试发送给 main agent\n- Session key 1: `main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8` → 失败（No session found）\n- Session key 2: