s\\\",\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"User\\\",\\n        \\\"user_view_type\\\": \\\"public\\\",\\n        \\\"site_admin\\\": false\\n      },\\n      \\\"author_association\\\": \\\"CONTRIBUTOR\\\",\\n      \\\"issue_field_values\\\": [],\\n      \\\"type\\\": null,\\n      \\\"active_lock_reason\\\": null,\\n      \\\"draft\\\": false,\\n      \\\"pull_request\\\": {\\n        \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/57529\\\",\\n        \\\"html_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/57529\\\",\\n        \\\"diff_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/57529.diff\\\",\\n        \\\"patch_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/57529.patch\\\",\\n        \\\"merged_at\\\": null\\n      },\\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"## Summary\\\\n- Adds `channel-list` and `channel-info` message actions to the MS Teams extension\\\\n- `channel-list`: lists channels in a team with displayName, description, membershipType\\\\n- `channel-info`: gets full channel details including webUrl and createdDateTime\\\\n- Both use Microsoft Graph `/teams/{id}/channels` endpoints\\\\n\\\\n## Test plan\\\\n- [x] Unit tests for `listChannelsMSTeams` (channels returned, empty team, undefined value)\\\\n- [x] Unit tests for `getChannelInfoMSTeams` (full details, sparse data)\\\\n- [x] `pnpm test -- extensions/msteams` passes (454 tests, 44 files)\\\\n- [x] `pnpm check` passes\\\\n\\\\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\\\",\\n      \\\"reactions\\\": {\\n        \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/57529/reactions\\\",\\n        \\\"total_count\\\": 1,\\n        \\\"+1\\\": 1,\\n        \\\"-1\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"laugh\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"hooray\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"confused\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"heart\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"rocket\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"eyes\\\": 0\\n      },\\n      \\\"timeline_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/