y_text\",\"text\":\"**Searching for candidate details**\\n\\nI need to gather details on the candidate for 59052. There’s also the issue of docs and usability, which might be older and need updating, totaling about 57 issues. I think I have just one new issue. I should identify the 1-2 most important ones. It might be helpful to perform a specific search on docs or usability within the last two hours, possibly using API queries for enhancements as well.\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8cZVJKP4qXYap5nv8uIEDkUu|fc_086b533551db42ec0169cd2572c89c8191ad9c8b23ade3f42e","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:openclaw/openclaw+is:issue+is:open+(label:documentation+OR+docs+OR+usability)+updated:%3E2026-04-01T12:00:00Z&sort=updated&order=desc&per_page=10","extractMode":"text","maxChars":12000},"partialJson":"{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:openclaw/openclaw+is:issue+is:open+(label:documentation+OR+docs+OR+usability)+updated:%3E2026-04-01T12:00:00Z&sort=updated&order=desc&per_page=10\",\"extractMode\":\"text\",\"maxChars\":12000}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_kxGxsa6Dn0IQ9UsYtcASMO3o|fc_086b533551db42ec0169cd2572c8a88191b04efde2862e0037","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:openclaw/openclaw+is:issue+is:open+regression+updated:%3E2026-04-01T12:00:00Z&sort=updated&order=desc&per_page=10","extractMode":"text","maxChars":12000},"partialJson":"{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:openclaw/openclaw+is:issue+is:open+regression+updated:%3E2026-04-01T12:00:00Z&sort=updated&order=desc&per_page=10\",\"extractMode\":\"text\",\"maxChars\":12000}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_IktgJFRkJjtAVDz2iopY90af|fc_086b533551db42ec0169cd2572c8b08191a8cb66cde18b8cd1","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:openclaw/openclaw+is:issue+is:open+label:%22bug:crash%22+updated:%3E2026-04-01T12:00:00Z&sort=updated&order=desc&per_p