\\\"repository_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw\\\",\\n      \\\"labels_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/59045/labels{/name}\\\",\\n      \\\"comments_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/59045/comments\\\",\\n      \\\"events_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/59045/events\\\",\\n      \\\"html_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/59045\\\",\\n      \\\"id\\\": 4187070381,\\n      \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"I_kwDOQb6kR875kZ-t\\\",\\n      \\\"number\\\": 59045,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"[Bug]: v2026.3.31 breaks exec on local loopback setups\\\",\\n      \\\"user\\\": {\\n        \\\"login\\\": \\\"clumsyzombie\\\",\\n        \\\"id\\\": 15150210,\\n        \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTUwMjEw\\\",\\n        \\\"avatar_url\\\": \\\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15150210?v=4\\\",\\n        \\\"gravatar_id\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/clumsyzombie\\\",\\n        \\\"html_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/clumsyzombie\\\",\\n        \\\"followers_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/clumsyzombie/followers\\\",\\n        \\\"following_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/clumsyzombie/following{/other_user}\\\",\\n        \\\"gists_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/clumsyzombie/gists{/gist_id}\\\",\\n        \\\"starred_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/clumsyzombie/starred{/owner}{/repo}\\\",\\n        \\\"subscriptions_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/clumsyzombie/subscriptions\\\",\\n        \\\"organizations_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/clumsyzombie/orgs\\\",\\n        \\\"repos_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/clumsyzombie/repos\\\",\\n        \\\"events_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/clumsyzombie/events{/privacy}\\\",\\n        \\\"received_events_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/clumsyzombie/received_events\\\",\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"User\\\",\\n        \\\"user_view_type\\\": \\\"public\\\",\\n        \\\"site_admin\\\": false\\n      },\\n      \\\"labels\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"id\\\": 9706244967,\\n          \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACQomLZw\\\",\\n          \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/labels/bug\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n          \\\"color\\\": \\\"d73a4a\\\",\\n          \\\"default\\\": true,\\n          \\\"description\\\": \\\"Something isn't working\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"id\\\": 10313822852,\\n          \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"LA_kwDOQb6kR88AAAACZsByhA\\\",\\n          \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/labels/regression\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"regression\\\",\\n          \\\"color\\\": \\\"D93F0B\\\",\\n          \\\"default\\\": false,\\n          \\\"description\\\": \\\"Behavior that previously worked and now fails\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"state\\\": \\\"open\\\",\\n      \\\"locked\\\": false,\\n      \\\"assignees\\\": [],\\n      \\\"milestone\\\": null,\\n      \\\"comments\\\": 0,\\n      \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-04-01T13:44:51Z\\\",\\n      \\\"updated_at\\\": \\\"2026-04-01T13:45:02Z\\\",\\n      \\\"closed_at\\\": null,\\n      \\\"assignee\\\": null,\\n      \\\"author_association\\\": \\\"NONE\\\",\\n      \\\"issue_field_values\\\": [],\\n      \\\"type\\\": null,\\n      \\\"active_lock_reason\\\": null,\\n      \\\"sub_issues_summary\\\": {\\n        \\\"total\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"completed\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"percent_completed\\\": 0\\n      },\\n      \\\"issue_dependencies_summary\\\": {\\n        \\\"blocked_by\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"total_blocked_by\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"blocking\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"total_blocking\\\": 0\\n      },\\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"### Bug type\\\\n\\\\nRegression (worked before, now fails)\\\\n\\\\n### Beta release blocker\\\\n\\\\nNo\\\\n\\\\n### Summary\\\\n\\\\nAfter upgrading to v2026.3.31, all exec calls fail with:\\\\n  \\\\\\\"gateway closed (1008): pairing required\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThis affects even basic commands like `openclaw --version`. The exec\\\\ntool cannot authenticate to the gateway on local loopback (ws://127.0.0.1:18789).\\\\n\\\\nGateway token auth IS configured (gateway.auth.mode: \\\\\\\"token\\\\\\\"), but\\\\nthe exec tool apparently cannot use it — every exec call registers\\\\nand fails immediately.\\\\n\\\\n### Expected behavior\\\\nexec should work on local loopback with token auth (worked in v2026.3.28)\\\\n\\\\n### Version\\\\n- OpenClaw: 2026.3.31\\\\n- Node: v24.14.1\\\\n- OS: WSL2 (linux 6.6.87.2-microsoft-standard-WSL2)\\\\n- Gateway: local loopback, auth token configured\\\\n\\\\n### Workaround\\\\nDowngrade to v2026.3.28\\\\n\\\\n### Steps to reproduce\\\\n\\\\n1. Have gateway running with auth.token configured + bind=loopback\\\\n2. Upgrade to v2026.3.31\\\\n3. Attempt any exec call (CLI or agent tool)\\\\n\\\\n### Expected behavior\\\\n\\\\nexec should work on local loopback with token auth (worked in v2026.3.28)\\\\n\\\\n### Actual behavior\\\\n\\\\nWorkaround\\\\nDowngrade to v2026.3.28\\\\n\\\\n### OpenClaw version\\\\n\\\\n2026.3.31\\\\n\\\\n### Operating system\\\\n\\\\nWSL2 (linux 6.6.87.2-microsoft-standard-WSL2)\\\\n\\\\n### Install method\\\\n\\\\n_No response_\\\\n\\\\n### Model\\\\n\\\\nminimax2.7\\\\n\\\\n### Provider / routing chain\\\\n\\\\n local loopback, auth token configured\\\\n\\\\n### Additional provider/model setup details\\\\n\\\\n_No response_\\\\n\\\\n### Logs, screenshots, and evidence\\\\n\\\\n```shell\\\\n\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### Impact and severity\\\\n\\\\n_No response_\\\\n\\\\n### Additional information\\\\n\\\\n_No response_\\\",\\n      \\\"reactions\\\": {\\n        \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/59045/reactions\\\",\\n        \\\"total_count\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"+1\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"-1\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"laugh\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"hooray\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"confused\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"heart\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"rocket\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"eyes\\\": 0\\n      },\\n      \\\"timeline_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/59045/timeline\\\",\\n      \\\"performed_via_github_app\\\": null,\\n      \\\"state_reason\\\": null,\\n      \\\"pinned_comment\\\": null,\\n      \\\"score\\\": 1\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/51645\\\",\\n      \\\"repository_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw\\\",\\n      \\\"labels_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/51645/labels{/name}\\\",\\n      \\\"comments_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/51645/comments\\\",\\n      \\\"events_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/51645/events\\\",\\n      \\\"html_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/51645\\\",\\n      \\\"id\\\": 4112688640,\\n      \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"I_kwDOQb6kR871IqYA\\\",\\n      \\\"number\\\": 51645,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Voice transcription not working in group/topic chats\\\",\\n      \\\"user\\\": {\\n        \\\"login\\\": \\\"web3blind\\\",\\n        \\\"id\\\": 264741654,\\n        \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"U_kgDOD8ejFg\\\",\\n        \\\"avatar_url\\\": \\\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264741654?v=4\\\",\\n        \\\"gravatar_id\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/web3blind\\\",\\n        \\\"html_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/web3blind\\\",\\n        \\\"followers_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/web3blind/followers\\\",\\n        \\\"following_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/web3blind/following{/other_user}\\\",\\n        \\\"gists_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/web3blind/gists{/gist_id}\\\",\\n        \\\"starred_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/web3blind/starred{/owner}{/repo}\\\",\\n        \\\"subscriptions_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/web3blind/subscriptions\\\",\\n        \\\"organizations_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/web3blind/orgs\\\",\\n        \\\"repos_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/web3blind/repos\\\",\\n        \\\"events_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/web3blind/events{/privacy}\\\",\\n        \\\"received_events_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/web3blind/received_events\\\",\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"User\\\",\\n        \\\"user_view_type\\\": \\\"public\\\",\\n        \\\"site_admin\\\": false\\n      },\\n      \\\"labels\\\": [],\\n      \\\"state\\\": \\\"open\\\",\\n      \\\"locked\\\": false,\\n      \\\"assignees\\\": [],\\n      \\\"milestone\\\": null,\\n      \\\"comments\\\": 4,\\n      \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-03-21T14:20:44Z\\\",\\n      \\\"updated_at\\\": \\\"2026-04-01T13:19:38Z\\\",\\n      \\\"closed_at\\\": null,\\n      \\\"assignee\\\": null,\\n      \\\"author_association\\\": \\\"NONE\\\",\\n      \\\"issue_field_values\\\": [],\\n      \\\"type\\\": null,\\n      \\\"active_lock_reason\\\": null,\\n      \\\"sub_issues_summary\\\": {\\n        \\\"total\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"completed\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"percent_completed\\\": 0\\n      },\\n      \\\"issue_dependencies_summary\\\": {\\n        \\\"blocked_by\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"total_blocked_by\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"blocking\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"total_blocking\\\": 0\\n      },\\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"## Description\\\\n\\\\nIn Telegram group and forum topic chats, voice messages are not being transcribed. When a user sends a voice message in a group/topic, the assistant receives the message but without the audio transcription.\\\\n\\\\n## Expected behavior\\\\n- Voice messages in group/topic should be transcribed the same way as in DM\\\\n- The assistant should receive the transcription text and be able to respond\\\\n\\\\n## Current behavior\\\\n- In DM: voice transcription works correctly\\\\n- In group/topic: receives message but no transcription - assistant replies \\\\\\\"Не могу прослушать голосовое — напиши текстом\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## Environment\\\\n- OpenClaw version: latest\\\\n- Channel: Telegram\\\\n\\\\n## Logs\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n## Possible cause\\\\nThe Telegram plugin may not be passing voice transcription data to the session for group chats, only for DM.\\\\n\\\\n## Workaround (if any)\\\\nUsers need to write in text or use DM for voice messages.\\\",\\n      \\\"reactions\\\": {\\n        \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/51645/reactions\\\",\\n        \\\"total_count\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"+1\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"-1\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"laugh\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"hooray\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"confused\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"heart\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"rocket\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"eyes\\\": 0\\n      },\\n      \\\"timeline_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/51645/timeline\\\",\\n      \\\"performed_via_github_app\\\": null,\\n      \\\"state_reason\\\": null,\\n      \\\"pinned_comment\\\": null,\\n      \\\"score\\\": 1\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/57243\\\",\\n      \\\"repository_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw\\\",\\n      \\\"labels_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/57243/labels{/name}\\\",\\n      \\\"comments_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/57243/comments\\\",\\n      \\\"events_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/57243/events\\\",\\n      \\\"html_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/57243\\\",\\n      \\\"id\\\": 4165518591,\\n      \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"I_kwDOQb6kR874SMT_\\\",\\n      \\\"number\\\": 57243,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"[Bug]: macOS companion app node host (openclaw-node) always connects to 127.0.0.1:18789 in remote mode, ignoring gateway.remote.url\\\",\\n      \\\"user\\\": {\\n        \\\"login\\\": \\\"christian-lallo\\\",\\n        \\\"id\\\": 147324086,\\n        \\\"node_id\\\": \\\"U_kgDOCMf8tg\\\",\\n        \\\"avatar_url\\\": \\\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147324086?v=4\\\",\\n        \\\"gravatar_id\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/christian-lallo\\\",\\n        \\\"html_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/christian-lallo\\\",\\n        \\\"followers_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/christian-lallo/followers\\\",\\n        \\\"following_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/christian-lallo/following{/other_user}\\\",\\n        \\\"gists_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/christian-lallo/gists{/gist_id}\\\",\\n        \\\"starred_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/christian-lallo/starred{/owner}{/repo}\\\",\\n        \\\"subscriptions_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/christian-lallo/subscriptions\\\",\\n        \\\"organizations_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/christian-lallo/orgs\\\",\\n        \\\"repos_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/christian-lallo/repos\\\",\\n        \\\"events_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/christian-lallo/events{/privacy}\\\",\\n        \\\"received_events_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/users/christian-lallo/received_events\\\",\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"User\\\",\\n        \\\"user\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"80c65c64e663cce1\\\">>>\"\n}"}],"details":{"url":"https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:openclaw/openclaw+is:issue+is:open+regression+updated:%3E2026-04-01T12:00:00Z&sort=updated&order=desc&per_page=10","finalUrl":"https://api.github.com/search/issues?q=repo:openclaw/openclaw+is:issue+is:open+regression+updated:%3E2026-04-01T12:00:00Z&sort=updated&order=desc&per_page=10","status":200,"contentType":"application/json","extractMode":"text","extractor":"j